catalog.plans (sync, key: code)
  + code=team  name=Team
  ~ code=pro  name: Pro -> "Pro Plan"
  - code=legacy
  1 to insert, 1 to update, 1 to delete
  Through foreign keys, the deletion of this row also reaches other rows:
    1 row of billing.invoices (plan_code) references it through invoices_plan_code_fkey, ON DELETE SET NULL, so the deletion sets plan_code of this row to NULL.
    2 rows of billing.subscriptions (plan_code) reference it through subscriptions_plan_code_fkey, ON DELETE CASCADE, so the deletion deletes these rows too.

